6274799587086795\">https://x.com/mightyohm/status/1746274799587086795</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1746282993503571980</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1746282993503571980\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-01-13T21:28:04Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1746284129702789532":{"a":"<p>No one used email when I was in college in the 90s. My CS teacher explained, &quot;Don&#x27;t call me. Email me. I might be flying my plane when you try to call. I&#x27;ll answer your email when I am not busy.&quot; Mind you emailing him required getting time in the computer lab if it was even open. <a href=\"https://x.com/HithaHerzog/status/1746279985847955671\">Tweet by @HithaHerzog</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/HithaHerzog/status/1746279985847955671\">https://x.com/HithaHerzog/status/1746279985847955671</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1746284129702789532</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1746284129702789532\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-01-13T21:32:35Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1746284623355658475":{"a":"<p>Also, I guess I should also point out that a telephone in the 90s was a box that hanged on the wall of your kitchen. Or maybe another room if you were lucky.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1746284623355658475</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1746284623355658475\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-01-13T21:34:33Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"}}